From 12a0193d678625a4c4d56f71296d73af3d350375 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:20:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(2d): allow Deburr in verified aligned setups

Prove turned Deburr matches baked geometry for entity and selection sources.
Keep unverified-kind refusal coverage with Probe.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #2284
